  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Carolyn Balogh joined education, family enterprise, real estate, and Hungarian community service across Northeast Ohio. After earning her education degree from Ohio University, she taught in several cities, helped lead Mar-Bal, Inc. as human resource manager and chief financial officer, managed Balogh Real Estate LLP, and supported Hungarian Cultural Garden programs and events."
    ]
